:"TokenDistributed emitted per non-zero-balance token","details":"For each token the five weighted legs (BTCB, ETH, XVS, USDT, USDC) transfer      `balance * weight / MAX_BPS`, then the U buyback receives the re-read remaining      balance. Reading the remainder rather than computing U's share guarantees the      contract ends at zero for every token and absorbs integer-division dust as well as      any fee-on-transfer wobble on the intermediate legs.","params":{"tokens":"The tokens to distribute (order irrelevant; duplicates are harmless no-ops        after the first pass since the balance is then zero)"}}},"stateVariables":{"BTCB_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"ETH_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"USDC_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"USDT_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"U_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"},"XVS_BUYBACK":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"state-variable-immutable"}},"title":"TreasuryTokenBuybackDistributor","version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"WeightsMisconfigured(uint256)":[{"notice":"Thrown when the configured weights do not sum to MAX_BPS"}],"ZeroAddressNotAllowed()":[{"notice":"Thrown if the supplied address is a zero address where it is not allowed"}]},"events":{"TokenDistributed(address,uint256)":{"notice":"Emitted once per token after it has been fully distributed"}},"kind":"user","methods":{"BTCB_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"BTCB Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"BTCB_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the BTCB buyback (15%)"},"ETH_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"ETH Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"ETH_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each token routed to the ETH buyback (15%)"},"MAX_BPS()":{"notice":"Denominator for the weight basis points"},"USDC_BUYBACK()":{"notice":"USDC Treasury TokenBuyback contract"},"USDC_WEIGHT()":{"notice":"Share of each